Third-party components
----------------------
This repository bundles open-source web fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1) under
client/public/fonts/, and self-hosts the MediaPipe WASM runtime and pose model
(provisioned at build time from the npm package and a one-time download). As a
result the app makes no third-party network requests at run time. Other
dependencies are installed via npm. Third-party licenses and any required
attributions are summarized in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

